# `unit`/`acceptance` install this lock *after* track2/build-requirements.
# lock (§5.5), silently upgrading the approved setuptools==77.0.3 --
# the exact PEP 639 wheel-layout version -- before either wheel build
# runs. Must always equal build-requirements.in's own setuptools pin.
